+
+### 9. Replan Proposal ✓
+
+**模型覆盖：**
+- `ReplanProposal` 实体存在
+- 字段：replanScope, triggerEventIds, basePlanVersionId, selectedCandidatePlanId, status, affectedCommitmentIds
+- 生命周期：draft → awaiting_confirmation → accepted / rejected / expired / no_feasible_plan
+
