+---
+
+### 10. CandidatePlan / ScoreBreakdown ✓
+
+**模型覆盖：**
+- `CandidatePlan` 实体存在
+- 字段：rank, feasibility, finalScore, scoreDelta, changeCount, rationale, scoreBreakdown, preservedCommitmentCount, affectedCommitmentCount
+
+**证据：**
